---
description: Git workflow basics — always applied
alwaysApply: true
---

- Branches: `feat/<slug>`, `fix/<slug>`, `chore/<slug>`, `docs/<slug>`, `refactor/<slug>`.
- Commits: Conventional Commits — `type(scope): subject`.
- Squash merge to `main`. Linear history. Delete branch after merge.
- One PR per logical change.
- Submodule `.ai-kit` pinned by commit; bump via `git submodule update --remote .ai-kit`.

Full detail: `.ai-kit/ai/conventions/git.md`.
